# ignore all scoped-review files
#
# .why = these are review OUTPUT, the same kind the neighbor `peer/` dir already ignores. left
#        tracked, they join `--diffs since-main` and are reviewed as TARGETS on the next round —
#        so each scoped re-run written to work around a context overflow makes that overflow
#        deeper. the artifacts are the record a human reads, never a deliverable to grade.
*
!.gitignore
